{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++20 (64) code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++20 (64) code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nusing LL = long long;\nusing ULL = unsigned long long;\n\nconst int P1 = 998244353;\nconst int P2 = 1e9 + 7;\nconst int half = 1000000;\n\ninline int mod(LL x, int P) {\n    x %= P;\n    return x < 0 ? x + P : x;\n}\n\nconst int pow10[] = {1, 10, 100, 1000, 10000, 100000, 1000000, 10000000, 100000000};\n\nint ans, tot1;\nLL n, tot2;\nLL s[10];\nvector<int> vec[10];\n\nvoid init(int x, int v) {\n    if (x > 6) return;\n    vec[x].push_back(mod(tot1 - v, P1));\n    s[x] += mod(tot1++ - v, P1);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) init(x + 1, v * 10 + i);\n}\n\ninline bool check(LL x) {\n    return x * half + half - 1 <= n && x * half * 10 > n;\n}\n\nvoid solve(int x, LL v) {\n    if (v > n) return;\n    if (check(v)) {\n        for (int i = 0; i <= 6; ++i) {\n            int t = mod(tot2 + 1 - v * pow10[i], P1);\n            int loc = lower_bound(vec[i].begin(), vec[i].end(), P1 - t) - vec[i].begin();\n            ans = mod(ans + s[i] + 1LL * t * vec[i].size() - 1LL * P1 * (vec[i].size() - loc), P2);\n        }\n        tot2 += tot1;\n    } else {\n        ans = mod(ans + mod(++tot2 - v, P1), P2);\n        for (int i = (!x); i < 10; ++i) solve(x + 1, v * 10 + i);\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    cin >> n;\n    init(0, 0);\n    for (int i = 0; i <= 6; ++i) sort(vec[i].begin(), vec[i].end());\n    tot2 = -1;\n    solve(0, 0);\n    cout << ans;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int P1 = 998244353;\n    static final int P2 = 1000000007;\n    static final int half = 1000000;\n    static final int[] pow10 = {1, 10, 100, 1000, 10000, 100000, 1000000, 10000000, 100000000};\n\n    static int ans, tot1;\n    static long n, tot2;\n    static long[] s = new long[10];\n    static ArrayList<Integer>[] vec = new ArrayList[10];\n\n    static int mod(long x, int P) {\n        x %= P;\n        return (int)(x < 0 ? x + P : x);\n    }\n\n    static void init(int x, int v) {\n        if (x > 6) return;\n        int cur1 = tot1;\n        tot1++;\n        vec[x].add(mod(cur1 - v, P1));\n        int cur2 = tot1;\n        tot1++;\n        s[x] += mod(cur2 - v, P1);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) init(x + 1, v * 10 + i);\n    }\n\n    static boolean check(long x) {\n        return x * half + half - 1 <= n && x * half * 10 > n;\n    }\n\n    static int lowerBound(ArrayList<Integer> list, int key) {\n        int low = 0, high = list.size();\n        while (low < high) {\n            int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n            if (list.get(mid) < key) low = mid + 1;\n            else high = mid;\n        }\n        return low;\n    }\n\n    static void solve(int x, long v) {\n        if (v > n) return;\n        if (check(v)) {\n            for (int i = 0; i <= 6; ++i) {\n                int t = mod(tot2 + 1 - v * pow10[i], P1);\n                int loc = lowerBound(vec[i], P1 - t);\n                long term = s[i] + (long)t * vec[i].size() - (long)P1 * (vec[i].size() - loc);\n                ans = mod(ans + term, P2);\n            }\n            tot2 += tot1;\n        } else {\n            tot2++;\n            ans = mod(ans + mod(tot2 - v, P1), P2);\n            for (int i = (x == 0 ? 1 : 0); i < 10; ++i) solve(x + 1, v * 10 + i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextLong();\n        for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) vec[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        init(0, 0);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= 6; ++i) Collections.sort(vec[i]);\n        tot2 = -1;\n        solve(0, 0);\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -4.076874756719917e-05, -1.7523612768854946e-05, 0.0, -1.966933996300213e-05, -0.3222980499267578, -6.305972783593461e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.52720492426306e-05, -0.0019356340635567904, -6.9141146923357155e-06, -0.00168503331951797, -0.0006388768670149148, -8.22540732769994e-06, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -4.887569048150908e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.5759401917457581, -0.0015044810716062784, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -8.022463589441031e-05, -0.014164037071168423, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.006717480253428221, 0.0, 0.0, -1.0251946150674485e-05, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.003604345954954624, -0.0009115354623645544, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -5.900685573578812e-05, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.9802276912960224e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -6.9141146923357155e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -0.0015025765169411898, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.536738616588